# Reference: target-threshold delivery solution.
#
# Identical to `40_fixed_delivery.oms`; the level's `target 1` is what makes
# the run stop right after the delivery instead of at the 30-step limit.
#
# This is solution.
# The level is defined in `examples/44_target_delivery.oml`.

# Arm at (3,3); rotation 0 -> hand at (2,4).
place arm 3 3                       # id 4

# Grab the molecule, swing it four steps onto the exit, then release.
action 4 1 grab
action 4 2 rotate_clw
action 4 3 rotate_clw
action 4 4 rotate_clw
action 4 5 rotate_clw
action 4 6 release
